WEBVTT

00:00:11.684 --> 00:00:14.124
S-Stop it! Give it back!

00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:18.184
Stop it? You talk real big for such a weakling!

00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:21.554
Have some more!

00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:26.554
Why must I...

00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:29.464
suffer like this?

00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:35.944
Hey!

00:00:37.874 --> 00:00:39.584
Hide, what's wrong?!

00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:41.984
Who's the weakling now?

00:00:46.554 --> 00:00:48.744
Is... Is he?!

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:02.804
I've decided. From now on,
I'll be a righteous hero

00:01:02.804 --> 00:01:05.204
who will rid the world of scum like you.

00:01:06.644 --> 00:01:09.874
I am... Masked Justice!

00:01:21.054 --> 00:01:23.524
How deplorable.

00:01:23.524 --> 00:01:26.984
They don't even consider the
trouble they cause society.

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:36.094
It would seem that this night too
calls for Masked Justice to appear!

00:01:44.174 --> 00:01:44.974
Hey!

00:01:44.974 --> 00:01:45.914
You okay?!

00:01:49.014 --> 00:01:51.614
Reflect on your misdeeds as you suffer.

00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:56.574
This is!

00:01:57.354 --> 00:02:01.024
He's here! Masked Justice!

00:02:02.124 --> 00:02:04.294
Justice has been served!

00:02:07.264 --> 00:02:10.164
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:13.434
Maji de ii kanji

00:02:13.804 --> 00:02:16.574
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:02:17.014 --> 00:02:20.174
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:02:22.044 --> 00:02:23.214
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:23.214 --> 00:02:24.384
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:02:24.384 --> 00:02:25.614
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:02:25.614 --> 00:02:27.284
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:27.284 --> 00:02:28.344
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:02:28.484 --> 00:02:31.824
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:02:31.824 --> 00:02:34.264
Kokoro no limiter

00:02:34.994 --> 00:02:37.654
Tokihanatareta hora

00:02:38.094 --> 00:02:41.294
Yes! Change the world!

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:44.404
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:02:44.704 --> 00:02:48.004
Real wo tsuranuite

00:02:48.004 --> 00:02:51.244
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:02:51.244 --> 00:02:54.184
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:02:55.314 --> 00:03:01.784
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:03:01.784 --> 00:03:07.694
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:03:08.124 --> 00:03:14.534
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:03:14.764 --> 00:03:19.304
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:03:19.304 --> 00:03:23.364
We can try over the future world!

00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:23.974
Yeah!

00:03:24.744 --> 00:03:25.404
Saidai!

00:03:27.544 --> 00:03:28.774
Daitan!

00:03:38.054 --> 00:03:39.724
14th sense.
"Brilliant Minds?! The Children Are Great Detectives!"

00:03:39.724 --> 00:03:41.224
14th sense.
"Brilliant Minds?! The Children Are Great Detectives!"
It was awesome!

00:03:41.224 --> 00:03:41.954
It was awesome!

00:03:42.124 --> 00:03:45.634
The cop cars came flying in and there
were TV crews all over the place!

00:03:45.634 --> 00:03:47.934
And then they broadcast the story
right in front of my house!

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:52.304
What's got him so excited
this early in the morning?

00:03:52.304 --> 00:03:53.774
He struck again last night.
That "Masked Justice" guy.

00:03:53.774 --> 00:03:55.504
Masked Justice Strikes Again!!
He struck again last night.
That "Masked Justice" guy.

00:03:55.504 --> 00:03:56.844
Masked Justice Strikes Again!!
Oh, that guy who comes out at
night to kick peoples' butts?

00:03:56.844 --> 00:03:58.274
Serial Criminal Sneers at Police
Oh, that guy who comes out at
night to kick peoples' butts?

00:03:58.274 --> 00:04:00.284
Serial Criminal Sneers at Police
All he does is torture people by choking them.

00:04:00.284 --> 00:04:00.844
All he does is torture people by choking them.

00:04:00.844 --> 00:04:02.984
He doesn't beat them in a fight.

00:04:02.984 --> 00:04:05.614
Apparently it happened right near Tono's house.

00:04:05.614 --> 00:04:09.614
I don't see why he'd be boasting
about something like that.

00:04:10.654 --> 00:04:12.024
What's with you girls?!

00:04:12.024 --> 00:04:15.124
I was just telling everyone what it was like!

00:04:15.124 --> 00:04:16.764
Oh, sure!

00:04:16.764 --> 00:04:19.304
You don't have act so high and mighty about it!

00:04:19.304 --> 00:04:20.164
What?!

00:04:20.164 --> 00:04:21.034
Come and get me!

00:04:21.764 --> 00:04:25.704
What would you do if you ran into
Masked Justice on the street?

00:04:25.704 --> 00:04:27.604
What? I'd be so scared!

00:04:27.604 --> 00:04:30.174
It's okay. That'd never happen.

00:04:30.174 --> 00:04:31.074
But...

00:04:31.074 --> 00:04:32.984
I'm telling you, just relax.

00:04:32.984 --> 00:04:36.914
I wonder if they'll catch this
Masked Justice guy soon.

00:04:36.914 --> 00:04:39.244
We'll catch him, no matter what.

00:04:39.884 --> 00:04:41.654
Who is he to call himself Masked Justice?

00:04:41.654 --> 00:04:43.754
He's a coward who pretends to be a hero.

00:04:43.754 --> 00:04:47.494
Are you girls gonna catch him?
Gonna be the junior detective squad now?

00:04:47.494 --> 00:04:49.634
Don't you dare do something that dangerous!

00:04:49.634 --> 00:04:51.964
No, I meant the police will catch him.

00:04:55.534 --> 00:04:58.904
They may call me in for this case, though.

00:05:05.044 --> 00:05:06.604
Okay, let's start.

00:05:09.354 --> 00:05:14.754
The criminal dated her before
the murder. Arrest him at once.

00:05:19.564 --> 00:05:21.924
This woman is already dead.

00:05:23.194 --> 00:05:24.964
Her location is...

00:05:26.404 --> 00:05:29.234
Enough! Stop it.

00:05:31.234 --> 00:05:32.744
You don't have to do this.

00:05:32.744 --> 00:05:33.744
But I'm not done.

00:05:33.744 --> 00:05:38.274
Chief, you've been making her
see bloody crimes like these?

00:05:38.274 --> 00:05:41.244
You think I enjoy giving my permission for it?

00:05:42.084 --> 00:05:45.984
Everything here is vital evidence
from unsolved cases.

00:05:46.584 --> 00:05:49.794
The police and other espers have had
no luck at all, so we have no choice.

00:05:49.794 --> 00:05:54.024
I understand that,
but these are monstrous crimes!

00:05:54.424 --> 00:05:58.094
Shiho may be a Level 7 esper,
but she's still a ten-year-old!

00:05:58.094 --> 00:05:58.964
I'm fine.

00:05:59.094 --> 00:06:00.804
That doesn't make it right!

00:06:00.804 --> 00:06:05.894
As your supervisor... No, as an adult,
I won't allow you to do this!

00:06:10.814 --> 00:06:13.044
Yes. Chief, the head of the
National Police Agency is here.

00:06:13.484 --> 00:06:15.384
The chief of the NPA?

00:06:15.384 --> 00:06:17.404
Show him in.

00:06:22.794 --> 00:06:24.654
Pardon my barging in like this.

00:06:24.654 --> 00:06:26.464
Chief.

00:06:26.464 --> 00:06:29.334
Are you the one making Shiho do this?

00:06:29.334 --> 00:06:31.294
Stop right there, Minamoto.

00:06:31.294 --> 00:06:32.234
Who's?

00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:34.704
Minamoto, The Children's supervisor.

00:06:34.704 --> 00:06:36.074
Ah, you are?

00:06:36.074 --> 00:06:40.044
Isn't part of a police chief's duty
to protect children from crime?

00:06:40.044 --> 00:06:41.904
I can't go along with this any further.

00:06:41.904 --> 00:06:44.914
Our job is to make sure espers
have a sound upbringing!

00:06:44.914 --> 00:06:47.584
If they have the power to solve a case,

00:06:47.584 --> 00:06:49.784
then it is their duty as a citizen to provide it.

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:52.984
Age is irrelevant. Isn't that right, Shiho?

00:06:53.124 --> 00:06:54.414
Yes, Daddy.

00:06:54.754 --> 00:06:57.054
D-D-Daddy?!

00:06:57.894 --> 00:07:03.064
It's not generally known, but the
chief is Miss Sannomiya's father.

00:07:03.064 --> 00:07:05.394
I appreciate your concern for my daughter.

00:07:05.394 --> 00:07:06.534
Seriously?

00:07:06.534 --> 00:07:08.534
There's no need for you to worry about Shiho.

00:07:08.534 --> 00:07:10.534
This is an esper's duty.

00:07:10.534 --> 00:07:12.534
Shiho, could you step out for a moment?

00:07:12.534 --> 00:07:14.174
I have something to discuss with your chief.

00:07:14.174 --> 00:07:15.334
Yes, Daddy.

00:07:17.044 --> 00:07:20.634
The fact is, there's a case I'd like
your permission to use The Children on.

00:07:21.014 --> 00:07:23.914
This way. You can relax and
drink some juice or somethi...

00:07:26.524 --> 00:07:28.454
Um, let's go!

00:07:32.094 --> 00:07:35.624
Chief, you can't involve a child more
deeply in a criminal investigation!

00:07:35.624 --> 00:07:38.064
Please, just hear me out on this...

00:07:38.064 --> 00:07:39.504
But, sir!

00:07:39.504 --> 00:07:43.004
All right, I'll hear you out, but later, all right?

00:07:43.004 --> 00:07:45.334
But for now, I'm ordering you to step outside.

00:07:46.034 --> 00:07:50.404
I will not cooperate unless there's
a damned good reason to!

00:07:50.744 --> 00:07:52.244
What's wrong? Come on.

00:07:52.244 --> 00:07:53.614
Let's go, Shiho.

00:08:04.324 --> 00:08:07.224
I can't believe the head of the National Police...

00:08:07.224 --> 00:08:10.464
has asked us to consult on
the Masked Justice case.

00:08:10.464 --> 00:08:12.664
No matter how weird the case is,
letting him run around...

00:08:12.664 --> 00:08:15.404
doing as he pleases is getting to be
an embarrassment for the police.

00:08:15.404 --> 00:08:18.104
Well, it's got Chisato and the others scared,

00:08:18.104 --> 00:08:20.204
so we'd better solve it, fast.

00:08:20.204 --> 00:08:20.944
Right.

00:08:20.944 --> 00:08:25.714
Maybe so, and I hate to say it, but
should a father really ask this?

00:08:25.714 --> 00:08:27.314
Don't be so mad, Mr. Minamoto.
Daddy has his position to consider.

00:08:27.314 --> 00:08:29.384
Masked Justice Case File
Don't be so mad, Mr. Minamoto.
Daddy has his position to consider.

00:08:29.384 --> 00:08:30.514
Masked Justice Case File
What's the big deal? It means
her dad depends on her.

00:08:30.514 --> 00:08:32.684
What's the big deal? It means
her dad depends on her.

00:08:32.684 --> 00:08:33.584
Exactly!

00:08:33.584 --> 00:08:35.554
Still...

00:08:39.224 --> 00:08:41.794
I figured out the perp's m.o.

00:08:41.794 --> 00:08:44.864
It's simple, but extremely effective.

00:08:44.864 --> 00:08:47.334
But before I explain it...

00:08:47.334 --> 00:08:50.804
You all eat every day, right?
Where does the food go in?

00:08:50.804 --> 00:08:51.734
Our mouths.

00:08:51.734 --> 00:08:53.574
And where do you breathe in from?

00:08:53.574 --> 00:08:54.204
Our mouths.

00:08:54.204 --> 00:08:55.474
Exactly!

00:08:55.474 --> 00:08:58.374
Food goes from your mouth to your
stomach through the esophagus.

00:08:58.374 --> 00:09:01.114
Air goes through the trachea to the lungs.

00:09:01.114 --> 00:09:04.084
So, why do you suppose food
doesn't go into your lungs?

00:09:05.654 --> 00:09:07.714
The answer is this!

00:09:07.824 --> 00:09:08.224
ESOPHAGUS
TRACHEA

00:09:08.224 --> 00:09:10.954
ESOPHAGUS
TRACHEA
The trachea has a lid on it.

00:09:10.954 --> 00:09:14.794
ESOPHAGUS
TRACHEA
When food is passing by, this lid,
called the epiglottis, shuts.

00:09:14.794 --> 00:09:17.194
ESOPHAGUS
TRACHEA
And thus keeps food out of the lungs.

00:09:18.134 --> 00:09:20.064
Then the criminal must be!

00:09:20.064 --> 00:09:21.234
What do you mean?

00:09:21.234 --> 00:09:22.994
What if that lid is forced closed?

00:09:23.434 --> 00:09:26.574
Um... You wouldn't be able to breathe!

00:09:26.574 --> 00:09:27.674
I see!

00:09:27.674 --> 00:09:31.044
I think our perp holds the
epiglottis shut via psychokinesis.

00:09:31.044 --> 00:09:35.184
To do that, he'd need Level 3 PK powers.

00:09:35.184 --> 00:09:36.714
Precisely!

00:09:36.714 --> 00:09:38.154
Thanks, Sakaki.

00:09:38.154 --> 00:09:43.054
I wouldn't need such a violent method
to take someone's breath away.

00:09:43.524 --> 00:09:46.794
I just need to look in their
eyes and purse my lips...

00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:49.094
Of course, it only works on women.

00:09:50.264 --> 00:09:51.254
Huh?!

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:57.874
The Children, released!

00:09:57.874 --> 00:09:58.604
<<RELEASED>>
The Children, released!

00:09:59.104 --> 00:10:02.504
Born an esper, fate has made
me a hand of the police!

00:10:02.504 --> 00:10:05.974
If you're a woman, you can bet on one thing!
No matter how tangled, I'll solve the mystery!

00:10:05.974 --> 00:10:08.814
I'll pick up any trail! Smash any alibi!

00:10:08.814 --> 00:10:10.784
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:10:14.084 --> 00:10:15.814
You can't run!

00:10:18.654 --> 00:10:20.854
Good! Good! Now, let's try
and get you undressed!

00:10:26.864 --> 00:10:30.764
You're The Children? I'm Uchida,
the supervisor here. A pleasure.

00:10:31.304 --> 00:10:36.074
'Sup?! Now that we're here, whatever the case,
we'll bring it to a dead end!

00:10:36.074 --> 00:10:38.204
Dead ends are bad, you know.

00:10:38.644 --> 00:10:39.714
This is the scene?

00:10:39.714 --> 00:10:44.274
Yes. The victim collapsed in
front of this vending machine.

00:10:50.794 --> 00:10:53.124
No sign of any large force
having been applied here.

00:10:53.494 --> 00:10:56.894
It doesn't seem to have received a
telepathic or hypnotic attack, either.

00:10:56.894 --> 00:10:58.534
Just like Dr. Sakaki said,

00:10:58.534 --> 00:11:02.064
we'd be safe to assume psychokinesis was
used to close the victim's epiglottis.

00:11:02.064 --> 00:11:05.404
But I can't see the perpetrator.

00:11:05.404 --> 00:11:07.474
Could he have aimed from far away?

00:11:07.474 --> 00:11:12.514
Maybe, but considering his power,
I don't think he was that far.

00:11:12.514 --> 00:11:15.444
Still, it's hard to pin down exactly where he was.

00:11:15.444 --> 00:11:17.384
No different from what the other espers said.

00:11:18.784 --> 00:11:23.354
Even Level 7 psychometry is
useless when we need it most.

00:11:23.354 --> 00:11:24.994
You don't have to say it like that, surely!

00:11:24.994 --> 00:11:28.054
Your daughter is trying her best!

00:11:29.124 --> 00:11:32.964
Is her being my daughter
related to this investigation?

00:11:33.964 --> 00:11:37.574
We requested BABEL's assistance
because we require Level 7 power.

00:11:37.574 --> 00:11:39.234
I understand, Daddy.

00:11:39.234 --> 00:11:43.074
Mr. Uchida, could you show
me to the other scenes?

00:11:43.074 --> 00:11:44.614
Starting with the first one.

00:11:44.614 --> 00:11:45.644
Understood.

00:11:45.644 --> 00:11:47.984
Wow, Shiho's all kinds of awesome today.

00:11:47.984 --> 00:11:51.884
Unlike us, her powers are
kinda made for stuff like this.

00:11:51.884 --> 00:11:55.154
Maybe she'll follow in her dad's
footsteps and become a cop.

00:11:55.154 --> 00:11:58.824
C'mon, we both know you did it.
Why not tell me the truth?

00:11:58.824 --> 00:12:00.394
I told you, I don't know nuthin'!

00:12:00.394 --> 00:12:02.564
No use trying to hide it.

00:12:02.564 --> 00:12:04.934
I'll know, all the same.

00:12:04.934 --> 00:12:08.294
Go on, show me everything that's in your heart.

00:12:12.634 --> 00:12:15.004
Ooh, investigate me!

00:12:15.574 --> 00:12:17.414
This is the first crime scene.

00:12:17.414 --> 00:12:22.314
The perp claimed responsibility to the
media and the police shortly afterward.

00:12:22.314 --> 00:12:23.254
What time?

00:12:23.254 --> 00:12:29.484
2 A.M. This is the only scene
where the victim saw the perp,

00:12:29.484 --> 00:12:31.824
but the boy who was attacked
was so traumatized,

00:12:31.824 --> 00:12:33.724
that he says he can't remember anything.

00:12:42.234 --> 00:12:43.734
What's wrong, Shiho?

00:12:43.734 --> 00:12:47.204
No good. He's an esper, but my
clairvoyance isn't working.

00:12:47.204 --> 00:12:49.204
Should we go to the next scene?

00:12:49.204 --> 00:12:50.304
Please.

00:12:50.474 --> 00:12:52.844
A boy setting off firecrackers and fireworks

00:12:52.844 --> 00:12:54.944
in this convenience store parking lot

00:12:54.944 --> 00:12:57.384
suddenly collapsed with respiratory distress.

00:12:58.014 --> 00:13:01.184
We have no word of any
witnesses who saw the perp.

00:13:04.824 --> 00:13:09.464
No good. This is the best position
to go for the victim, but...

00:13:09.464 --> 00:13:11.534
Weird. Not here, either?

00:13:11.534 --> 00:13:14.034
Could he have done it from
really, really far away?

00:13:14.034 --> 00:13:16.664
Maybe we should expand our
area of investigation a bit.

00:13:17.704 --> 00:13:19.704
No good. I don't see anything.

00:13:19.704 --> 00:13:22.304
I can't believe that. Go in further.

00:13:24.144 --> 00:13:25.414
Nothing.

00:13:25.414 --> 00:13:26.944
I said go in further!

00:13:26.944 --> 00:13:28.184
We can't go any further!

00:13:28.184 --> 00:13:30.204
Oh, for Pete's sake!

00:13:31.784 --> 00:13:32.514
Hey!

00:13:33.654 --> 00:13:35.154
Kaoru? Shiho?

00:13:35.154 --> 00:13:36.654
Minamoto!

00:13:36.654 --> 00:13:37.624
What's wrong?!

00:13:37.624 --> 00:13:39.854
We're stuck! Get us out!

00:13:40.894 --> 00:13:43.394
So, we ended up striking out at every scene.

00:13:43.394 --> 00:13:45.884
Meting out punishment to naughty boys.

00:13:45.994 --> 00:13:48.294
He really is a faceless ally of justice, huh?

00:13:48.364 --> 00:13:52.204
No. What I saw had nothing to do with justice.

00:13:53.744 --> 00:13:57.644
It was uglier. A mass of selfish hatred.

00:13:59.344 --> 00:14:01.584
Okay, let's call it a day.

00:14:01.584 --> 00:14:03.884
Agreed! To the baths! To the baths!

00:14:03.884 --> 00:14:07.424
Yeah, a deadlocked case calls
for a change of pace.

00:14:07.424 --> 00:14:08.974
That's part of the mystery, too?

00:14:09.924 --> 00:14:12.084
Oh, that's great!

00:14:12.494 --> 00:14:14.264
I love a bath.

00:14:14.264 --> 00:14:15.764
And why am I here?

00:14:15.764 --> 00:14:18.534
Better to do it with us than
back at the dorm, right?

00:14:18.534 --> 00:14:20.654
You tired? Want me to scrub your back?

00:14:21.234 --> 00:14:22.364
Cut it out, Creepy!

00:14:23.534 --> 00:14:28.204
Naomi, have you ever thought of using
your powers to punish bad guys?

00:14:28.204 --> 00:14:31.244
I do that on my missions. We all do, right?

00:14:31.244 --> 00:14:35.374
I don't mean that. Like,
on drunks or rude people.

00:14:35.444 --> 00:14:38.714
Well, I'd give them fair warning, first.

00:14:38.714 --> 00:14:42.454
Yeah. Just attacking them
out of the blue is wrong.

00:14:42.454 --> 00:14:44.724
Hi, ho! Good job!

00:14:44.724 --> 00:14:47.054
Yes! Luck! More pretty girls have arrived!

00:14:47.364 --> 00:14:50.794
Naomi, Supervisor Tanizaki's
wandering in front of the door.

00:14:50.794 --> 00:14:52.694
He seems to be waiting for you.

00:14:53.264 --> 00:14:54.464
That creepy old guy!

00:14:54.464 --> 00:14:54.764
Women's Bath
That creepy old guy!

00:14:54.764 --> 00:14:55.304
Women's Bath

00:14:55.304 --> 00:14:57.304
Women's Bath
She's in there with The Children.

00:14:57.304 --> 00:15:00.244
Women's Bath
I can't allow that! It's no good for her upbringing!

00:15:00.244 --> 00:15:02.874
Women's Bath
They might have a bad influence on my Naomi.

00:15:02.874 --> 00:15:03.804
They might have a bad influence on my Naomi.

00:15:03.914 --> 00:15:06.944
Or possibly molesting her
in some unspeakable way.

00:15:06.944 --> 00:15:09.684
Unforgivable! She's going to be BABEL's... No!

00:15:09.684 --> 00:15:12.884
The world's greatest esper!

00:15:13.014 --> 00:15:18.484
There mustn't be a single flaw in her
powers, her beauty, or her personality!

00:15:18.894 --> 00:15:21.664
I'm worried. Should I go in?

00:15:21.664 --> 00:15:24.434
Can I go in? I'm her supervisor, after all.

00:15:24.434 --> 00:15:26.724
We're going to be married, someday!

00:15:27.304 --> 00:15:29.294
Anybody home?

00:15:33.404 --> 00:15:36.174
That creep! If it weren't for that!

00:15:36.174 --> 00:15:38.544
No warning. Just straight up clobbered him.

00:15:38.544 --> 00:15:41.344
What if the criminal's afraid to warn them?

00:15:41.984 --> 00:15:44.584
Kaoru and Naomi's powers are high-level,

00:15:44.584 --> 00:15:47.954
but the criminal's aren't. Or else...

00:15:48.024 --> 00:15:49.254
What's wrong?

00:15:49.254 --> 00:15:51.754
He's looking for people to attack.

00:15:51.754 --> 00:15:53.964
He doesn't just find them by chance.

00:15:53.964 --> 00:15:57.594
If he doesn't have someone to attack,
he goes looking for one.

00:15:57.594 --> 00:15:59.594
And?

00:15:59.594 --> 00:16:02.264
It's right on the tip of my brain, but I don't know.

00:16:02.264 --> 00:16:03.754
But I almost have it.

00:16:04.774 --> 00:16:06.134
You mean that case, right?

00:16:06.134 --> 00:16:07.474
What, you know about it?

00:16:08.474 --> 00:16:11.644
We're a clairvoyant and a telepath, remember?

00:16:11.644 --> 00:16:13.984
Minamoto's just obsessing over it.

00:16:13.984 --> 00:16:16.214
You can sense it without
even trying to read him.

00:16:16.214 --> 00:16:18.654
He keeps thinking "I have to protect Shiho!"

00:16:21.284 --> 00:16:23.054
Oh, you didn't know?

00:16:23.794 --> 00:16:28.354
I... try to avoid reading Mr. Minamoto's mind.

00:16:33.464 --> 00:16:35.124
Sorry for the wait!

00:16:37.434 --> 00:16:39.204
Ah, that was a great bath!

00:16:39.204 --> 00:16:40.844
Oh? Where's Mr. Minamoto?

00:16:40.844 --> 00:16:43.504
He went to get some data.
Please wait here for him.

00:16:43.814 --> 00:16:47.334
What's with him? I hate guys
who take long baths!

00:16:47.414 --> 00:16:50.004
No, no, he's not in the bath.

00:16:51.684 --> 00:16:52.944
A car..?

00:16:56.224 --> 00:16:57.354
Mr. Minamoto!

00:16:57.354 --> 00:16:58.694
Sorry for the wait!

00:16:58.694 --> 00:17:02.454
Mr. Minamoto, Chief Sannomiya
contacted me before.

00:17:03.834 --> 00:17:07.394
He asked that you take the two girls
here and report to his office.

00:17:07.704 --> 00:17:09.634
Just Kaoru and Aoi?

00:17:09.634 --> 00:17:10.764
Yes.

00:17:11.234 --> 00:17:13.724
I don't think he wants her
to hear what he has to say.

00:17:15.274 --> 00:17:18.404
Understood. Come on Kaoru, Aoi.

00:17:24.614 --> 00:17:26.414
Where are the others going?

00:17:26.554 --> 00:17:28.724
They just got other orders.

00:17:28.724 --> 00:17:31.814
You and I will continue the
investigation, Miss Shiho.

00:17:32.624 --> 00:17:33.284
Oh.

00:17:33.864 --> 00:17:36.494
You were touch touching the ground
in the BABEL parking lot.

00:17:36.494 --> 00:17:38.894
The perp isn't in BABEL, is he?

00:17:38.894 --> 00:17:40.864
No, it's not that.

00:17:41.264 --> 00:17:44.504
I just suddenly realized that he might be in a car.

00:17:44.504 --> 00:17:46.234
A car, you say?

00:17:46.234 --> 00:17:49.244
He targets his victims from the car,
then flees immediately.

00:17:49.244 --> 00:17:52.944
That way, he'd leave no trace at the scene.

00:17:52.944 --> 00:17:55.434
Now, if we can just figure out the exact car...

00:17:56.014 --> 00:17:57.154
I see.

00:17:57.154 --> 00:18:01.354
Called you here? I never did that.

00:18:01.354 --> 00:18:04.724
But, that detective said you didn't
want her to hear something.

00:18:04.724 --> 00:18:05.694
You don't suppose!

00:18:10.864 --> 00:18:13.894
Could you move the car to that avenue there?

00:18:14.904 --> 00:18:16.864
Okay, no problem.

00:18:27.544 --> 00:18:31.444
Thought so. He could see the
victim from here, even in a car.

00:18:45.134 --> 00:18:46.864
So, you've figured it out.

00:18:47.304 --> 00:18:48.104
You!

00:18:48.104 --> 00:18:49.304
Exactly.

00:18:49.304 --> 00:18:53.734
It was easy to slip through the patrols,
no matter how tight they were.

00:18:54.904 --> 00:18:56.844
Because I am Masked Justice.

00:18:57.714 --> 00:19:00.304
It's hard to detect psychic waves
in regular medical exams.

00:19:00.614 --> 00:19:03.944
Luckily, my ESP hasn't been detected until now.

00:19:04.584 --> 00:19:07.674
It's heaven telling me that what I do is just.

00:19:13.624 --> 00:19:17.634
No need to be afraid. You have two choices.

00:19:17.634 --> 00:19:22.594
Either become Justice Girl and help me let
the young reflect on their misdeeds, or...

00:19:22.864 --> 00:19:27.234
Forget it! I'm a special esper!
Who'd want to be your Justice Girl?!

00:19:28.644 --> 00:19:31.664
Then you must reflect on your misdeeds!

00:19:38.284 --> 00:19:41.914
How do you feel? Do you suffer? Feel anguish?

00:19:42.284 --> 00:19:46.524
Then reflect! Realize the sin
of what you just said!

00:19:49.524 --> 00:19:54.334
Poor girl. What can a psychometrist
do in this situation?

00:19:57.404 --> 00:20:00.964
How about use her limiter to
call her friends for help?

00:20:04.944 --> 00:20:08.204
PSYCHIC EJECTOR SEAT!

00:20:16.454 --> 00:20:17.824
Shiho! Speak to me!

00:20:18.354 --> 00:20:19.624
You okay, Shiho?!

00:20:22.324 --> 00:20:26.664
Why? Why must Masked Justice be defeated?

00:20:26.664 --> 00:20:29.634
Justice will not allow it!

00:20:29.964 --> 00:20:31.864
Come on, Shiho.

00:20:32.034 --> 00:20:34.164
I'm fine! I can walk on my own!

00:20:36.474 --> 00:20:38.034
Divine retribution!

00:20:38.344 --> 00:20:39.834
Shiho, look out!

00:20:45.014 --> 00:20:45.884
Daddy!

00:20:47.854 --> 00:20:49.254
Why, you!

00:20:50.554 --> 00:20:52.024
Eat this!

00:20:53.524 --> 00:20:54.324
Chief!

00:20:54.324 --> 00:20:55.724
Daddy, speak to me!

00:20:55.724 --> 00:20:59.064
I'm fine. You're not hurt, are you, Shiho?

00:21:00.264 --> 00:21:01.524
Daddy...

00:21:04.634 --> 00:21:05.894
Thank you, Daddy.

00:21:14.044 --> 00:21:16.954
Thanks for worrying about me, Mr. Minamoto.

00:21:16.954 --> 00:21:18.814
I know how daddy is,

00:21:18.814 --> 00:21:21.344
but I can read his mind, so I
know how he really feels.

00:21:22.154 --> 00:21:24.254
Inside, he was really happy.

00:21:24.254 --> 00:21:27.194
That you want so much to protect his daughter.

00:21:28.324 --> 00:21:32.264
So, stop thinking you're a stranger
and that it's none of your business.

00:21:32.994 --> 00:21:34.664
That helps to know.

00:21:34.664 --> 00:21:37.324
But please, don't just go
poking into my thoughts.

00:21:37.474 --> 00:21:43.134
My powers taught me long ago that
the world isn't like a fairy tale.

00:21:43.474 --> 00:21:47.704
So, you don't have to try to hide
the ugliness in it from me.

00:21:50.514 --> 00:21:52.514
I'm fine.

00:21:52.514 --> 00:21:54.674
I'm fine, because I know that
I have Kaoru and Aoi...

00:21:54.784 --> 00:21:58.654
and daddy and you to protect me.

00:22:00.724 --> 00:22:03.194
That really does help to know.

00:22:03.324 --> 00:22:06.664
You're more grown up than I am.

00:22:10.734 --> 00:22:16.204
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.204 --> 00:22:16.474
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.794
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:44.064
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.434 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.174
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.444 --> 00:23:00.114
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.554 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.094 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.264
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.264 --> 00:23:12.994
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.134 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.834
Anata e

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:20.474
Hai hai!

00:23:20.474 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.194
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.194 --> 00:23:42.924
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.924 --> 00:23:43.194
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.694 --> 00:23:46.064
Hello. Sorry to have called you here like this.

00:23:46.064 --> 00:23:48.664
You said it was an emergency, sir?

00:23:48.664 --> 00:23:51.074
We've received a request from
the Comerican esper team...

00:23:51.074 --> 00:23:52.374
for a joint mission with BABEL.

00:23:52.374 --> 00:23:53.174
Huh?

00:23:53.174 --> 00:23:56.744
Fine, we'll just get Colonel
Gooly-gooly ourselves!

00:23:56.744 --> 00:23:57.944
Colonel Grisham!

00:23:57.944 --> 00:23:58.914
Ugh...

00:23:58.914 --> 00:24:00.614
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:00.614 --> 00:24:03.584
Episode 15: "The Golden Rule. Don't Run Away!"

00:24:03.584 --> 00:24:04.914
All right, go to it!

00:24:04.914 --> 00:24:04.984
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.914
The Golden Rule!
Don't Run Away!!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.914 --> 00:24:09.944
The Golden Rule!
Don't Run Away!!
